	(text "The arrows into U2 are its inputs; the AXP192 also charges the battery on BAT (pins 34, 35) and the backup cell on BACKUP (pin 30). IPSOUT also feeds the AXP192's own DC-DC and LDO inputs (VIN1-3, LDOIN, APS)."
